{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgg4pGTKqaJa6GSubG22q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I used the full Tanabe–Sugano quartet matrices for high-spin d⁵ (including configuration interaction) and fitted all three bands exactly. The results are **Dq ≈ 685 cm⁻¹ (10Dq ≈ 6850 cm⁻¹), B ≈ 362 cm⁻¹ and C ≈ 3951 cm⁻¹**.\n\n**1. ⁴E band: gives a relation between B and C**\n\nThe ground state is ⁶A₁g. In octahedral d⁵, the ⁴A₁g and ⁴Eg(G) levels lie at 10B + 5C above the ground state at every value of Dq. So the 23 370 cm⁻¹ band gives:\n\n10B + 5C = 23 370 cm⁻¹, which means C = (23 370 − 10B)/5.\n\n**2. ⁴T₁g(G) and ⁴T₂g(G) bands: fix Dq and B**\n\nThe energies are measured from the ground state at −35B. Each matrix is written in the strong-field basis t₂⁴e, t₂³e², t₂²e³.\n\nThe ⁴T₁ matrix is:\n| −25B+6C−10Dq | 3√2B | C |\n| 3√2B | −16B+7C | −3√2B |\n| C | −3√2B | −25B+6C+10Dq |\n\nThe ⁴T₂ matrix is:\n| −17B+6C−10Dq | −√6B | C |\n| −√6B | −22B+5C | −√6B |\n| C | −√6B | −17B+6C+10Dq |\n\nCheck: the diagonal sums equal the free-ion term sums (⁴G + ⁴P + ⁴F and ⁴G + ⁴D + ⁴F), so the matrices are consistent.\n\nI substituted C from step 1 and set the lowest eigenvalue + 35B equal to 19 180 cm⁻¹ for ⁴T₁ and 22 130 cm⁻¹ for ⁴T₂. I then solved for Dq and B numerically. Four different starting guesses all converged to the same values, with residuals below 10⁻⁸ cm⁻¹:\n\n- Dq ≈ 685 cm⁻¹\n- B ≈ 362 cm⁻¹\n- C ≈ 3951 cm⁻¹\n- C/B ≈ 10.9\n\n**Caveats**\n\n- Three bands and three parameters means the fit is exact. Nothing checks the assignment independently, so the error in each parameter comes only from the error in the band positions.\n- The Dq value assumes the bands come from an octahedral MnCl₆ chromophore, as in solid MnCl₂.\n\n{\"Dq\": 685, \"B\": 362, \"C\": 3951, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Exact fit of the three quartet bands using the full d5 Tanabe-Sugano matrices with 4E at 10B+5C.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":655,"cache_read_input_tokens":2986,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":655,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28a1041a-a102-4dc8-a303-4c4a82052851","uuid":"eb7cd27f-3dee-4d2b-9e34-1bddd0f9dac5","timestamp":"2026-11-03T13:23:14.319Z","request_id":"req_011Cgg4pG7zQKqwYB8Vw6qvs"}
